{"title":"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Official_MAA)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Official MAA)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Simple_Modular_Arithmetic)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Simple Modular Arithmetic)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> can be written in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/0/c4038b216970f4d961f73db65ba7bccc239a230c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{a}\\text{ }\\underline{b}\\text{ }\\underline{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" />, can be written in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d846bf00428a2d8756ea1ce44f8cf3896e3b80d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{a}\\text{ }\\underline{c}\\text{ }\\underline{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" />, and can be written in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3db101b1dbe921ab771ce865658621cc83bec38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{a}\\text{ }\\underline{c}\\text{ }\\underline{a}\\text{ }\\underline{c}\\text{ }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"11\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d25634d7212302efdeb3702974863759bfb74d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />. Find the base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have these equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3b814467433d8fddb99aae2f738646bea4962c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$196a+14b+c=225a+15c+b=222a+37c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"364\" height=\"14\" />.\nTaking the last two we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6224c4b04c5173039cac423c1c924b75607f2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+b=22c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"14\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5061ac0ea7f3b0c9eb6387005ae6c28eac6bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46dd8bcb9b266c694852928c51c743213a621eb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ngtr 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/2/0b28c249e0458c84e607a4b6cca5b98eb0c188f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Then we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf8ff3318d805ed14c6fa8a3f5a19cc31a302227.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+b=22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />.\nTaking the first two equations we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76bd33a1b875fda09f88381f0b0b9905cef8f636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29a+14c=13b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" />. Combining the two gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41a54f19df7a2cd56a6bdcb9f1d7c9f4b3673aa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4, b=10, c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />. Then we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc42db3ea3ce967792e66bf2c094588932495d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222 \\times 4+37 \\times1=\\boxed{925}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"193\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3b814467433d8fddb99aae2f738646bea4962c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$196a+14b+c=225a+15c+b=222a+37c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"364\" height=\"14\" />. Combining the first and third equations give that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac62714cddbd3e28bbbe2fb00e92866e9ebeac97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$196a+14b+c=222a+37c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"226\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79f7237333448056277996827cd1fc35a50602b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7b=13a+18c\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"14\" />\nThe second and third gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e93daf4e795d794d10a69e9372ea39167f984211.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222a+37c=225a+15c+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"225\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/f/5ff50c994e51bb7e6572f3d15d647ed4532942d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[22c-3a=b\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"12\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/9/149335df3383a74f21f113f80e24158b75e5668e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[154c-21a=7b=13a+18c\\]\" width=\"225\" height=\"14\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab235348bde65763a0ff8fca5660fd9ad2900bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4c=a\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />\nWe can have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c33bcc9245d6ec279a8a579aa4c6483ea2519de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4,8,12,16,20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" />, but only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7ffa3b8792f0170bce1ab6008e907343100d70e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> falls within the possible digits of base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7ffa3b8792f0170bce1ab6008e907343100d70e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, and thus you can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> which equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/2/c4225df995aca320841d5834ae31ec002ea8b9ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot225+1\\cdot15+10=\\boxed{925}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"216\" height=\"23\" />.\n~SHEN KISLAY KAI 2023\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Official_MAA.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Official_MAA)\">Solution 3 (Official MAA)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Official MAA)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem is equivalent to finding a solution to the system of Diophantine equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/0/ba0ea09b9560515c3e48069ccf8aeccb6eb0c95f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$196a+14b+c=225a+15c+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"255\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845d699350e8e7b67992c8f6a6a218abb98aaf7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$225a+15c+b=216a+36c+6a+c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"302\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b2ae47730bb6c34fdb0d778ceaed76732faace7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le a\\le 5,\\,0\\le b\\le 13,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/f/d4f4ca37bff4738c78b66c67264bd59b0c6db3b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le c\\le 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" /> Simplifying the second equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efb89be96b95f8b57490007428fa378bf601d42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=22c-3a.$\" width=\"102\" height=\"12\" /> Substituting for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> in the first equation and simplifying then gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db07311c12fc75c38da3b296279e559d0b6c94e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f98b3f405113241659d8c8db2ea3480346db4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/3/6837ddc8e0dad6c771946686b6648d3c899ed795.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> and the base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9ea52979783d92b1800f16d9cca4f26422cead62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222 \\cdot 4 + 37 \\cdot 1 = 925.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"167\" height=\"14\" /> It may be verified that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e5bd2ae2db2e47c2b5d6f7b4543d534ad1fdd0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=10\\le 13.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Simple_Modular_Arithmetic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Simple_Modular_Arithmetic)\">Solution 4 (Simple Modular Arithmetic)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Simple Modular Arithmetic)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We're given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/6/a76fbafa1978657969be7406342e6668c949bdd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$196a+14b+c=225a+15c+b=222a+37c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"371\" height=\"16\" /> By taking the difference of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equalities, we receive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1266dba40997a1733e58ef636c28cad1b975361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29a+14c=13b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" /> Taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/343cfbde0b7a8df0524887a862ea4854c6cfda73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" />, we receive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79f0e29e261c5be0a5c0b6040d92315b43f3b81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+c \\equiv 0 \\pmod{13}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" /> We receive the following cases: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee7c5f055c50ca9ec15c2c44a838e91dde68c25b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,c)=(4,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/8/9386b9e66c8fdeaa6cea46badd00ba057e3c466e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,4).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" /> (Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8bd5db8574209fe06220a5d9407e04faa1b1658.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> doesn't work since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f97f84dcb809603972082e759a2bb4389f917cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,c&lt;6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> by third condition). We can just check these two, and find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e50ec74ee8b7b133596088797699bb53c5da039d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(4,10,1),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /> and just plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a53387373f79f3f15a70abeeb58639c7d60aa2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> into the third expression we receive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/31245acffa9a115b37492d09ef40dec6c3cd1d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$888+37=\\boxed{925}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"137\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~SirAppel\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WVtbD8x9fCM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WVtbD8x9fCM</a>\n~Shreyas S\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I\" title=\"2018 AIME I\">2018 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2018\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2018 AIME I Problems/Problem 12